         <div class="container">
            
            <h2 class="text-center text-capitalize mb-5">Programs Of Interest</h2>
            
            <div class="row">
               <div class="col-12 col-lg-4 d-flex">
                  <div class="w-100 mb-4"><a class="card red-top chevron-card text-black drop-shadow-card h-100 p-3 p-lg-4" title="Certified Medical Assistant - Certificate" href="/academics/degrees-and-programs/medical-assistant/certified-med-asst-cert.html">
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                           <h5>Certified Medical Assistant - Certificate</h5>
                           <p class="mb-0 font-family-accent">Make a difference in patients’ lives while building a rewarding career in healthcare.
                              Certified Medical Assistants (CMAs) are an essential part of the healthcare team,
                              working alongside physicians, nurses, and other medical professionals to provide quality
                              patient care.</p>
                        </div></a></div>
               </div>
               <div class="col-12 col-lg-4 d-flex">
                  <div class="w-100 mb-4"><a class="card red-top chevron-card text-black drop-shadow-card h-100 p-3 p-lg-4" title="Electric Vehicle (EV) Charger Installation and Maintenance - Certificate" href="/academics/degrees-and-programs/automotive/electric-vehicle-charger-install-main-cert.html">
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                           <h5>Electric Vehicle (EV) Charger Installation and Maintenance - Certificate</h5>
                           <p class="mb-0 font-family-accent">Triton College’s hands-on, career focused program prepares you to meet the growing
                              demand for skilled technicians in this growing industry.</p>
                        </div></a></div>
               </div>
               <div class="col-12 col-lg-4 d-flex">
                  <div class="w-100 mb-4"><a class="card red-top chevron-card text-black drop-shadow-card h-100 p-3 p-lg-4" title="Vascular Technology in Sonography - Certificate" href="/academics/degrees-and-programs/health-sciences/vascular-tech-cert.html">
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                           <h5>Vascular Technology in Sonography - Certificate</h5>
                           <p class="mb-0 font-family-accent">If you have an aptitude for intellectually and technically challenging work and want
                              a health career with high patient contact, you should consider Triton's Vascular Sonography
                              certificate.</p>
                        </div></a></div>
               </div>
            </div>
            
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            </div>
         
