                        <h3 class="mt-3 text-capitalize text-primary-red fw-bold">Take The Next Step Into Your Future</h3>
                     </div>
                     <div class="col-12 col-lg-8 d-flex justify-content-center button-row-3 position-relative"><a class="icon-link" title="Visit Triton Link" href="/admissions-aid/admissions/visit-campus.html"><span class="fa-solid fa-map"></span><span>Visit Triton</span></a><a class="icon-link" title="Request Info Link" href="https://triton.elluciancrmrecruit.com/Apply/Account/Create?f=413414f8-3eca-4433-a3d2-80cbe7259466&amp;o=ae78e950-2e54-47d7-9574-18bab60f273a&amp;s=7fd9b0e2-14b9-e911-80db-0a83041e2672&amp;IsInquiry=True"><span class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></span><span>Request Info</span></a><a class="icon-link" title="Campus Map Link" href="/pages/campus-map.html"><span class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></span><span>View Campus Map</span></a></div>
